  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Nitric acid decomposes in sunlight as per reaction<br /><math> <mrow> <mn>4</mn> <msub> <mtext>HNO</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msub> <mo>&#10230;</mo> <mn>4</mn> <msub> <mtext>NO</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>+</mo> <mn>2</mn> <msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mtext>O</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <msub> <mtext>O</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>g</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math><br />Yellow colour is due to dissolved NO<sub>2</sub>(liq.)</p><p>NO<sub>2</sub>(g) is brown in colour but it is yellow in dissolved form.</p>",
